      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I have video example here:\nhttps://youtu.be/GSfmBf1Hap4?t=147\nHere i select very small avatar (the owner is seen above)\n\nhttps://youtu.be/GSfmBf1Hap4?t=172\nWhen i checking avatar, i noticed the camera cut off my arms and upper body. That is strange. Walked also strange, it bend little over.\nThe another slightly bigger but still small avatar has no problems with cut off and arms/hands stays visible. And walked also much better.\nThat is one in first link, the right one.\n\nSmall avatars are pretty much seen in VRChat btw, so i am asking myself if very small avatar is allowed - like one from Ant-man avatar as mini version - is also cut off arms and body.\n\nCan camera adjusted for it or are such (extreme) small avatars not allowed?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
